WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:07.540
♪ ♪

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:11.044
- GIVE ME A ROLL.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:14.147
- WHICH ONE YOU WANT?

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.282
- GIVE ME BOTH OF THEM, MAN.
- OKAY.

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:23.523
- I'LL DECIDE WHICH ONE I WANT
WHEN I WANT TO EAT IT.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:26.626
- MAYBE YOU WANT SOME
OF THESE VEGETABLES TOO?

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:29.228
- NAH, NAH.

00:00:29.261 --> 00:00:32.231
- OKAY.
JUST SAYING, MAN.

00:00:32.264 --> 00:00:36.069
THE NUTRIENTS IS GOOD FOR
MAINTAINING ENERGY LEVELS, SO...

00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:39.539
- I KNOW WHAT THE FUCK
A VEGETABLE IS, MAN.

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:41.808
DON'T TELL ME
WHAT A VEGETABLE IS, MAN.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:43.176
HEY.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.244
I'M A GROWN-ASS MAN,
ALL RIGHT?

00:00:45.277 --> 00:00:49.715
- MM-HMM. MM-HMM.
YEAH, I'M SORRY.

00:00:49.748 --> 00:00:52.218
THIS THREE-BEAN SALAD
IS THE BOMB, THOUGH.

00:00:52.251 --> 00:00:53.553
- OH, SNAP.

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:55.088
THEY GOT THREE-BEAN SALAD
UP IN THERE?

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:57.590
- MM-HMM.
- I DIDN'T EVEN SEE THAT.

00:00:57.623 --> 00:00:59.826
- YOU WANT SOME OF MINE?

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:00.860
- YEAH.

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:03.129
- OKAY.

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:06.466
OPEN THE HANGAR.

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.568
- WHAT YOU DOING?

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:10.503
NUH-UH.
YOU DON'T DO THAT.

00:01:10.536 --> 00:01:13.606
YOU DON'T FEED ME
LIKE A KID, MAN.

00:01:13.639 --> 00:01:16.442
I'M A GROWN-ASS MAN.
- OKAY. YEAH, SURE.

00:01:16.475 --> 00:01:18.211
YOU GOT SOME SCHMUTZ
RIGHT HERE.

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:19.512
- HEY, HEY, HEY, HEY!

00:01:19.545 --> 00:01:21.380
GET OFF MY FACE, NIGGA!

00:01:21.413 --> 00:01:23.149
YOU NEVER TOUCH
A GROWN MAN'S FACE!

00:01:23.182 --> 00:01:25.651
- THAT'S RIGHT.
I'M SORRY, OKAY?

00:01:25.684 --> 00:01:28.187
YOU ARE A GROWN-ASS--
- HEY, HEY, HEY!

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:30.223
I DON'T NEED YOU
TO PAT MY BACK!

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:31.157
I'M A GROWN-ASS MAN!

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:33.392
WHAT YOU DOING?
- I KNOW YOU'RE A GROWN--

00:01:33.425 --> 00:01:35.428
I DON'T WANT TO HEAR IT ANYMORE
ABOUT GROWN-ASS MAN.

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:37.363
- THAT'S WHAT I AM.
- I DON'T WANT TO HEAR IT--

00:01:37.396 --> 00:01:39.165
- WHY YOU HAVE TO TREAT ME--
- SHH. SHH.

00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:40.600
- YOU'RE TREATING ME
LIKE A KID.

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:42.468
- THIS IS NOT THE PLACE
FOR THIS KIND OF--

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:44.370
- [whimpering]
- DON'T START ACTING UP AGAIN.

00:01:44.403 --> 00:01:46.506
- 'CAUSE YOU'RE MAKING ME ANGRY.
- OKAY.

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:48.608
THEN I NEED YOU
TO BREATHE A LITTLE BIT.

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:50.276
CAN YOU BREATHE?
- [sniffling, exhaling deeply]

00:01:50.309 --> 00:01:51.711
- TAKE A BREATH.
JUST BREATHE.

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:53.246
- DON'T YOU TELL ME
HOW TO BREATHE.

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:54.514
- NO, NIGGA,
I WANT A MOTHERFUCKING

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:56.549
INSIDE VOICE UP IN THIS BITCH.

00:01:56.582 --> 00:01:58.784
DON'T BE GETTING LOUD
UP AROUND THESE WHITE PEOPLE.

00:01:58.817 --> 00:02:01.521
- YOU TREAT ME LIKE A BABY,
BUT I'M NOT A BABY.

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:02.922
- ARE YOU NOT A BABY?
- I'M NOT A BABY.

00:02:02.955 --> 00:02:03.890
- WHO PEE-PEED THEIRSELF?
- [crying]

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:05.858
- WHO LEFT THE PEE-PEE, HUH?
- I PEE-PEED.

00:02:05.891 --> 00:02:08.361
- DID YOU PEE-PEE YOURSELF?
- JUST A LITTLE BIT.

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:10.730
- OKAY, THEN LET'S GO TO
THE BATHROOM AND CHANGE, OKAY?

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.698
- I DON'T WANT TO CHANGE.
- YOU GOT TO CHANGE.

00:02:12.731 --> 00:02:14.534
- GET YOUR HANDS OFF OF ME!

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:15.868
- IS THAT HOW WE BEHAVE?

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:17.503
- [whining]
- IS THAT HOW WE BEHAVE?

00:02:17.536 --> 00:02:19.305
- STUPID BITCH!

00:02:19.338 --> 00:02:21.608
- [gasps]

00:02:23.709 --> 00:02:25.444
OH!
OH, I'M SORRY.

00:02:25.477 --> 00:02:27.246
I'M SORRY.
YOU A GROWN-ASS MAN.

00:02:27.279 --> 00:02:28.648
YOU A GROWN-ASS MAN.
- [crying]

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:30.216
- ARE YOU A--
WHO'S A GROWN-ASS MAN?

00:02:30.249 --> 00:02:32.318
YOU A GROWN-ASS MAN. OKAY?
- I AM.

00:02:32.351 --> 00:02:34.187
- YOU A GROWN-ASS MAN, RIGHT?
- I AM.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.289
- AND YOU KNOW
WHAT GROWN-ASS MEN DO?

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:37.790
YOU GO TO THE BATHROOM
AND CHANGE YOUR PANTS

00:02:37.823 --> 00:02:39.192
WHEN YOU GOT
THE PEE-PEE, RIGHT?

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:41.294
- YEAH.
- YEAH? OKAY, LET'S GO.

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:42.895
LET'S GO, ALL RIGHT?

00:02:42.928 --> 00:02:46.232
EXCUSE ME, EVERYBODY.

00:02:46.265 --> 00:02:49.769
I'M SORRY, BUT MY SON GOT
THAT BENJAMIN BUTTON'S DISEASE.

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:51.771
UM, HE'S FOUR.

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:52.804
- 4 3/4.

